#: config.cpp:36
msgid "Window Resize Handle"
msgstr "Ručica za změnjenje wulkosće wokna"

#: config.cpp:39
msgid "&Show handle"
msgstr "&Pokaž ručicu"

#: config.cpp:41
msgid ""
"When selected, all windows are drawn with a resize handle at the lower right "
"corner. This makes window resizing easier, especially for trackballs and "
"other mouse replacements on laptops."
msgstr ""
"Hdyž je to wubrane, so wšitke wokna z ručicu na prawym delnim róžku rysuja. To wolóži "
"změnjenje wulkosće, wosebje hdyž njesteji normalna myš k dispoziciji."

#: config.cpp:51
msgid "Here you can change the size of the resize handle."
msgstr "Tu móžeće wulkosć ručicy wubrać."

#: config.cpp:60
msgid "Small"
msgstr "Mała"

#: config.cpp:62
msgid "Medium"
msgstr "Srěnja"

#: config.cpp:64
msgid "Large"
msgstr "Wulka"

